frame: walkthrough needs a stop; without one, the bundle keeps the pick and
names the problem, and the reader opens Brief.
-- base/a.go --
package a
-- review.md --
---
frame: walkthrough
---
# A tour with nothing to step through

Only prose.
-- bundle.json --
{
  "base": "\u003cbase\u003e",
  "files": [],
  "flows": [],
  "frame": "walkthrough",
  "head": "\u003chead\u003e",
  "navigation": [],
  "not_shown": [],
  "problems": [
    {
      "line": 2,
      "message": "frame: walkthrough steps through the stops, and the document has none, so the review opens in brief. Add a `### path:from-to` stop, or pick brief."
    }
  ],
  "repository": "\u003crepository\u003e",
  "stops": []
}
